This is the first release of MacVogl, a port of the vogl package,
which is a gl-like graphics library.

The code is still in alpha stage. I am currently optimising
it for the Mac platform. Use it at your own risk and sanity.
Do observe that:

1.  ThinkC 5.01 is used for this version.
2.  Requires at least a 68020 CPU and 68881 FPU.
3.  Assumes that point 2 is always true. Doesn't check.
4.  Think C specific code is enclosed within #ifdef THINK_C.
5.  The Mac II driver is found in MacII.c

I welcome bug reports and fixes. I will try my best to incorporate
the suggestions in my next release. But no garantees (sp?).

